/-! ### Round 112 (R410, 2026-05-20) — partition-shape structural audit
    and 6+2+1 partial closure (χ(18) = majority case).

  **Layer partition audit summary**:

  | Shape    | Total | Edge-closed | Triple-closed | Survivors |
